{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちたーーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おに魂ではねいつも「乃木坂マスター」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってコーナーがあるんだけどその後の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲は必ず乃木坂なんだ！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこでいつも毎回どの曲にしようかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか今回このメンバーがおに魂では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピックアップされてるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このメンバーが歌唱してる楽曲にしようかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って考えたりしてるんだけどね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は急に「きっかけ」が聴きたくなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ中だからかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で1人で聴くのとはまた違って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大体、音楽聴く時って移動中だったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"するんだけどねラジオ中だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり聴き入っちゃた( ´;o;` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に良い曲で雨降ってる時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴くとより一層ジーンって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来るものがありますよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も沢山聴こう〜っと\\( ¨̮ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして土曜日の「それぞれの椅子」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会関東は久しぶりの4部制"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったのではりきってました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も喋り倒してやろう♡♡♡と（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"bre